---
import Book from '~/layouts/Book.astro';
import Land from '~/components/Land.astro';
import { u } from '~/i18n/ui';
---

<Book lang="tr" title="Sayfa bulunamadı" alternates={{ tr: '/', en: '/en/' }} noindex>
  <section class="wrap nf">
    <div>
      <p class="sign"><b>404 · HARİTADA YOK</b><span>00,0000° K · 00,0000° D</span></p>
      <h1 class="q">Bu arazi henüz haritada yok.</h1>
      <p>Aradığınız sayfa taşınmış ya da kaldırılmış olabilir. <a href={u('/projeler/')}>Çalışmalar</a> sayfasından ya da <a href={u('/')}>ana sayfadan</a> devam edebilirsiniz.</p>
      <p class="small muted">This page could not be found. <a href={u('/en/')}>English</a></p>
    </div>
    <Land seed="kayip-arazi-404" class="nf-land" threshold={0.5} levels={40} hair={0.5} />
  </section>
</Book>

<style>
  .nf {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 88px);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vw, 120px) 0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--t-xxl);
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 32px 0 24px;
  }
  .nf :global(.nf-land) {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .nf {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
